  m_text: "A Volume acts only on the cameras that read its layer. Environment \u203A Volumes \u203A Volume Mask lists the layers this camera reads; a Volume's layer is the Layer of its GameObject. Here a Volume on the layer Post-Grading turns the picture grey.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> This camera's Volume Mask is Default. Is its picture grey?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Add Post-Grading to this camera's Volume Mask.\n2. Set the Layer of Volume - Grey (layer Post-Grading) to Default, and look through another station's camera.\n3. Set its Layer back to Post-Grading.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: none</color></size>"
