  m_text: "Rendering \u203A Post Processing switches post-processing on or off for this camera only. Off, the camera shows the image as the lights and the materials draw it: no tonemapping, no bloom and no grading from any Volume.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Untick Post Processing on this camera. What disappears from its picture?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Untick Rendering \u203A Post Processing.\n2. Look through another station's camera: its picture has not changed.\n3. Tick Post Processing again.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: none</color></size>"
