  m_text: "<b>Camera</b>\n<size=70%>What the camera decides: where it stands, what it frames, what it draws.\n\n<b>Row 1 \xB7 Framing:</b> 1 The frame \xB7 2 Zoom vs walk \xB7 3 Tilt vs Lens Shift \xB7 4 Clipping planes\n<b>Row 2 \xB7 What it draws, and a moving camera:</b> 5 Background Type \xB7 6 Post Processing \xB7 7 Volume Mask \xB7 8 The breathing camera\n\nEvery station has its own camera. Select it and look through it in the Game view.</size>"
