  m_text: "A camera held by a person is never perfectly still: a slow, small drift makes a still frame feel filmed. Camera Breathing moves this camera with noise. Amplitude sets how far it moves (m), Rotation Amplitude how far it turns (\xB0), Speed how fast. Play mode only; in VR it switches itself off.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You raise Amplitude from 0.02 to 0.2 m. How will the picture move?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play and look through this camera in the Game view.\n2. Change Amplitude and Speed while it plays.\n3. Stop Play: the values go back, so set the ones you liked again.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: none</color></size>"
