      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Lights are placed for the picture, so the frame comes first. The hand-in is a 1920 \xD7 1080 video: 16:9, landscape. Most of the references are portrait. The half-transparent picture in front of this camera is reference 29, as tall as the frame (a Reference Overlay).\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Look through this camera. What fills the two sides of the 16:9 frame, where the reference shows nothing?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Set the Game view to 16:9 and look through this camera.\n2. Move the camera, the pole and the figure until the sides are part of the picture.\n3. Switch the Reference Overlay off to check.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Reference 29</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6055507529455485361, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
